  "body_html": "<p>Disclaimer: By reading this article, you acknowledge and agree to the <a href=\"https://www.cluseau.com/p/disclaimer\">terms and conditions</a></p><p>A lot of times success isn’t determined by <strong>how</strong> you trade, but rather <strong>what</strong> you trade. As markets become increasingly thematic, baskets and stories (<a href=\"https://x.com/blondesnmoney/status/1925674069795459506\">Uranium</a>, <a href=\"https://x.com/blondesnmoney/status/1912536727299711094\">Rare Earths</a>) seem to be more powerful than ever. I think <strong>desperation is a driver behind a good chunk of the move</strong> – many Americans, and in fact global investors, feel left behind and thus a need to break out of the rat race by generating massive gains. Companies with strong stories and narratives, combined with quick moves, <strong>help scratch this itch</strong>.</p><p>Are these investors putting the cart before the horse? Given a good chunk of the meme squad hasn’t generated a single dollar of actual revenue, it’s reasonable to say yes. Nonetheless, the price of a stock is simply what people are willing to trade it at 4 PM, and there are a few <strong>lesser-known names</strong> across AI Infrastructure, Critical Metals, and Defense, and Capital Markets that I think are worth a look. The purpose of this article is to briefly discuss them and bring them to your attention.</p><p></p><p><strong>Bleichroeder Acquisition Corp (BACQ)</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eyJV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eyJV!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eyJV!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eyJV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eyJV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eyJV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png\" width=\"975\" height=\"709\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/cb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:709,&quot;width&quot;:975,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:308770,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/176232032?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eyJV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eyJV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eyJV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eyJV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fcb8fef67-72c5-46a7-9d0e-aca9c77f8a92_975x709.png 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Bleichroeder Acqusition Corp is a SPAC intending to merge with Merlin Labs, an autonomous aviation contractor. Merlin Lab’s primary product, Merlin Pilot, combines proprietary hardware and software solutions with GE’s Flight Management System to fly a variety of aircraft, and can substantially reduce the need for large crews as Merlin Pilot can interface with Air Traffic Control and handle re-routing and collision avoidance.</p><p>Merlin has already won substantial long term business contracts. In 2024, Merlin secured a $105 Million contract from the US Air Force to retrofit C-130 Transport Aircraft with its Merlin Pilot system, and is in further discussion to expand this to the KC-135 Tanker Fleet. I think Merlin’s autopilot offering, which runs in partnership with GE’s Flight Management system (currently used on more than 14,000 military aircraft), has a strong opportunity to play a role in military readiness as drones and autonomous aviation play a larger role.</p><p>The SPAC transaction isn’t expected to close until early 2026, but what I like about BACQ is the <strong>favorable risk to reward of the trade</strong>. Spac Holders have the right to “redeem” their shares from the SPAC and receive cash. BACQ is currently trading at 10.88, and the redemption value is somewhere in the 10.40 – 10.50 range. As a result, your downside (up until the deal closes) is 30 to 40 cents, as you can simply “redeem” your shares upon the close of the transaction if the SPAC is trading below cash value. As a result, at 10.88, I think a favorable setup is in place as a move to $12-$14 would provide a significant gain relative to the 30 to 40 cents of risk you are taking.</p><p><strong>Willow Lane Acquisition Corp (WLAC)</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MgbP!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MgbP!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MgbP!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MgbP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MgbP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MgbP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png\" width=\"620\" height=\"445\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:445,&quot;width&quot;:620,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:135101,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/176232032?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MgbP!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MgbP!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MgbP!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!MgbP!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb12850c5-b3ea-49d2-8616-8dd2c289ad10_620x445.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Willow Lane Acqusition Corp intends to merge with “neocloud” provider Boost Run. Boost Run specializes in “Bare Metal” GPU hosting solutions where a tenant rents the entire server. Boost Run does not own data centers, rather, it partners with Tierpoint Data Centers to offer capacity across Charlotte, St. Louis, and Pennsylvania. Boost Run’s founder,  Andrew Karos, is well connected and previously ran high frequency trading firm Blue Fire Capital before it was purchased by Digital Asset Giant Galaxy Digital (who ironically, is also building data centers).</p><p>Boost Run has been profitable since inception in 2023, and has not needed outside Series A, B, or C funding.</p><blockquote><p>Boost Run has never raised Series A, B or C funding. They’ve grown organically while maintaining profitability. This transaction values Boost Runat roughly $614 million on a post-money basis, with over $112 million of cash added to Boost Runs balance sheet, assuming no redemptions by Willow Lane shareholders. Boost Run’s 2026 revenue midpoint of $180 million implies an attractive 3.4 times forward EV to revenue multiple, significantly below the comparables. We are very excited about this transaction.</p></blockquote><p>The company is cash flow positive, and is forecasting significant growth in 2026.</p><blockquote><p>Our financial course demonstrates what we believe is a powerful model. Pre-cash flow positive since year one, and we are committed to this principle. 2026 estimated revenue is $180 million at the midpoint. This represents approximately a 470% growth year-over-year. We generate strong profitability within the neo-cloud industry with adjusted EBITDA margins of approximately 80%.</p></blockquote><p>I hesitate to do “relative valuation” within the Neocloud industry, since practically anyone trades at sky high multiple (I sold Nebius at $30), but with Boost Run trading at an implied 5x EV / Revenue, it seems to be much cheaper than peers.</p><p>There is almost no coverage of Boost Run as of now, but I think that is likely to change quickly. Boost Run has an institutional call with DA Davidson later today, and I think heightened awareness will significantly benefit the stock.</p><p>While Boost Run is trading around 4 dollars higher than the SPAC redemption value (so significant downside is present), I think it provides an interesting opportunity to gain exposure to a neocloud provider at a sub-industry multiple.</p><div class=\"paywall-jump\" data-component-name=\"PaywallToDOM\"></div><p><strong>Up Fintech (TIGR)</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Un1U!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Un1U!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Un1U!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Un1U!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Un1U!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Un1U!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png\" width=\"1240\" height=\"741\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:741,&quot;width&quot;:1240,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:127408,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/176232032?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Un1U!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Un1U!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Un1U!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Un1U!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F5e682910-8479-4994-84ce-fc31e902136c_1240x741.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Up Fintech (or Tiger as I like to call them), has had a rapid fall from grace since it peaked at $12.90 in late August. At $9.50 (roughly 11x forward earnings), I find the setup interesting.</p><p>Tiger benefits significantly from “froth” in the US markets. The average “velocity” of its clients assets is upwards of 500%, which simply put, means that customers trade the value of their account several times over. Tiger does not offer free trading, and their commission revenue is thus a large beneficiary of heightened volatility.</p><p>Funded accounts are up 21% year over year, trading volume is up 170%, and most importantly, total clients assets are up 37% year over year to a record $52 Billion.</p><p>Contrary to popular belief, Tiger brokers doesn’t have a sizeable exposure to mainland Chinese markets and regulation. In recent years, it has entirely stepped away from offering services to mainland China, and more than 70% of its quarterly growth now comes from Singapore and Hong Kong.</p><p>The below charts are from Deustche, and I think they illustrate Tiger’s growth well.</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eTWM!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eTWM!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eTWM!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eTWM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eTWM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eTWM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png\" width=\"975\" height=\"756\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/dbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:756,&quot;width&quot;:975,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:223800,&quot;alt&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/176232032?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eTWM!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eTWM!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eTWM!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!eTWM!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fdbd5af7d-3f50-4572-a926-0f1dc5eadab0_975x756.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Tiger’s EPS is impacted by marketing expenditures, as they are spending significant sums on customer acquisition in Hong Kong and Singapore. The payback period is a very brief two quarters, so the return on this spend is highly beneficial to future results.  </p><p>Simply put, at just 11x forward earnings with accelerating growth and profitability, I think Tiger Brokers provides a way to “play the house” in an era of ever increasing market speculation. Ultimately, Tiger is still a second rate player next to its most frequently referenced peer, Futu (who has better technology and more expansive offerings), but there is a price for everything and I think at 11x, the Tiger setup is interesting.</p><p><strong>AMG Critical Materials (AMG:AMS)</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r6aL!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r6aL!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r6aL!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r6aL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r6aL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r6aL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png\" width=\"975\" height=\"582\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:582,&quot;width&quot;:975,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:274546,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/176232032?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r6aL!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r6aL!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r6aL!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!r6aL!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F7d3b016d-1b32-47cc-967a-bbc645bbb413_975x582.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Credit to @<a href=\"https://x.com/ArrakisGlobal\">ArrakisGlobal</a></p><p>AMG Critical Materials (as the name would imply) is a leading European Provider of Critical Metals such as Vanadium, Niobium, Lithium, and additional rare Earths. In recent months, AMG announced plans to build the first Chromium Production facility in the United States (which is slated to be completed in 2026), and is expanding facilities to recycle Vanadium. AMG has substantial ties across the Lithium Mining and Supply Chain, and is currently the only European Lithium Refiner via its production facility in Germany.</p><p>The stock is richly valued at 30x trailing earnings and roughly 18x 2026 earnings, but given the momentum behind the name and its position as one of the only European Lithium Refiners and its significant position across the Critical Metals supply chain, I think it is worth keeping on your watchlist.</p><p>Unlike a lot of rare earths names who are entirely pre-revenue, I think AMG’s track record of success, supply chain position, and their newly announced American facilities indicate that they are well poised to take advantage of heightened resource nationalism, and are in fact one of the only European pure play rare earths names.</p><p><strong>Itafos (IFOS:TSX)</strong></p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QXsD!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QXsD!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QXsD!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QXsD!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QXsD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QXsD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png\" width=\"975\" height=\"582\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:582,&quot;width&quot;:975,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:274546,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:true,&quot;topImage&quot;:false,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://www.cluseau.com/i/176232032?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QXsD!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QXsD!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QXsD!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!QXsD!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F34c9839d-8c40-47ea-a017-22d23ff8b4f0_975x582.png 1456w\" sizes=\"auto, 100vw\" loading=\"lazy\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"icon-noB79L\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>Credit to @<a href=\"https://x.com/KarstResearch\">KarstResearch</a></p><p>Itafos is a small Canadian Fertilizer Producer with a “lotto ticket” attached. Itafos is standalone attractive, and trades at roughly 3x EV / EBITDA and has built a substantial cash balance (98 Million CAD) that exceeds its debt (82 Million). The company is arguable already in a “critical industry” given the importance of fertilizer – <strong>China controls 35% of the Phosphate Based Fertilizer industry</strong>, and has further importance given its 10% stake in St George Mining (SGQ in Australia).</p><p>Itafos previously sold one of its Brazilian facilities, the Araxas mine, to St George for a mix of cash and 10% Equity (along with call options and performance rights to acquire additional shares).</p><p>It turns out the Araxas mine has substantial Niobium and rare earths, and is perhaps one of the only viable rare earth projects in South America. Earlier this week, St Geroge raised $72 Million AUD in capital to fund additional testing, permitting, and infrastructure at the site, and given the flock to rare earth names, the stock is up 300% since the beginning of September.</p><p>While SGQ might be interesting, I prefer to stick with Itafos as you are getting it at a standalone attractive valuation, with the “call option” of its 10% stake in St George, should the mining project become successful.</p><p>The stock has relatively thin liquidity despite the 500 Million market cap as Castlelake owns nearly 66%. <strong>While the lower liquidity may dissuade Institutional Interest, I like the sizeable insider ownership</strong>. The sizeable stake Castlelake established back in 2019 (when Itafos was under $1) and resulting alignment (Castlelake has two directors on the board) leads me to believe that the company will be run competently and for the benefit of the shareholders.</p><p><strong>Conclusion</strong></p><p>All of these names are highly speculative, and should be approached with caution. Whenever markets swoon, as they did on Friday, speculative names get pounded the most as people retreat to their core positions.</p><p>The rare earth, defense, and AI stories may suddenly fizzle out. If they don’t, however, I think these five names are worth keeping an eye on.</p>",
